id=doge_hypersimple_apk_liberator
name=App Blacklister
version=Hyper Simple Modules Collection v2.1 (2)
versionCode=2
author=mrdoge0
description=A hyper simple daemon module to blacklist specific apps that you choose by writing their package IDs to /data/adb/app_blacklist.txt. It also tries to keep your Android device open and ironSource-free, via having Android Developer Verifier, and ironSource's over-permissioned ad service (and potentially Israeli spyware) apps AppCloud (that is usually seen in Samsung devices) and AppServices (that is usually seen in Nothing devices) to the default blacklist.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mrdoge0/hypersimple-modules-collection/refs/heads/main/UPDATES/apk-liberator.json
